<!-- ========== WELCOME / ABOUT ========== -->
<section id="welcome" class="band reveal">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="feature">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--crimson)">New here?</p>
        <h2 style="color:var(--plum);margin-bottom:.9rem">What your first Sunday looks like</h2>
        <p class="lede" style="margin-bottom:1.3rem">Park anywhere in the lot on Peace Terrace, walk in, and someone will find you. Dress however you're comfortable. Bring the kids — we're used to the noise.</p>
        <ul class="infolist" style="max-width:none">
          <li><b>Arrive</b> 9:50 a.m. gives you time for coffee and a hello before we begin.</li>
          <li><b>Communion</b> Served every Sunday. Open to all — come forward or stay seated, either is fine.</li>
          <li><b>Children</b> Childcare for infants and toddlers; Kingdom Kidz for children through 6th grade.</li>
          <li><b>Language</b> Services are in English. Our congregation is majority Filipino, with families from across the Bay Area's many communities.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="card acc-c" style="margin-bottom:1.1rem">
          <h3>Who we are</h3><span class="kicker">Since 1964</span>
          <p>Saint Paul UMC is a multi-cultural, multi-generational faith community called to make disciples of Jesus Christ for the transformation of the world. Roughly 250 people worship here each week, including 50–60 children.</p>
          <p style="margin-bottom:0">We are part of the California-Nevada Annual Conference of The United Methodist Church.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card acc-g">
          <h3>Where to start</h3><span class="kicker">Three easy doors</span>
          <ul>
            <li><b>Sunday</b> Worship at 10 a.m., then stay for coffee</li>
            <li><b>Midweek</b> Join a Bible study or the Thursday line dancing class</li>
            <li><b>Serve</b> Come with us to Abode Shelter on a Friday</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

